{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"783273","name":"Athenian Montaza Hotel","description":"With a stay at Athenian Montaza Hotel in Kallithea, you'll be within a 10-minute drive of Acropolis and Syntagma Square. This hotel is 1. 7 mi (2. 7 km) from Acropolis Museum and 3. 4 mi (5. 5 km) from Parthenon. Make use of convenient amenities such as complimentary wireless Internet access, concierge services, and a communal living room. Featured amenities include a computer station, dry cleaning/laundry services, and a 24-hour front desk. Enjoy a meal at the restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the hotel's room service (during limited hours). A complimentary buffet breakfast is served daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM. Make yourself at home in one of the 43 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and minibars. Your Tempur-Pedic bed comes with premium bedding. Flat-screen televisions with digital programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected. Bathrooms feature showers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers.","address":"Leoforos Andrea Sygroy 156","city":"Athens","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"17671","lat":37.957815,"lng":23.717701,"stars":3,"giataCode":"1216417","phone":"+302114119595","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/78/783273/783273a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hot